Subject: [PATCH] phase24: establish normalized board rule context

---
 bible.md                                               | 10 ++++++++++
 .../PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_dru   |  5 +++++
 .../PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_pro   |  1 +
 3 files changed, 16 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_dru
 create mode 100644 pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_pro

diff --git a/bible.md b/bible.md
index 5dde3f45..c2d084f5 100644
--- a/bible.md
+++ b/bible.md
@@ -12555,3 +12555,13 @@ Stopped new engineering by explicit user direction. Archived pre-existing
 uncommitted and untracked worktree material outside the repository, left the
 authoritative branch clean, and finalized the self-contained successor packet.
 Phase 24 remains incomplete; Phase 25 was not started.
+
+# 2026-09-12 - Phase 24 selected-project rule context
+
+Added a target-basename KiCad project sidecar and copied the approved local
+JMS583 XIN/XOUT 0.10 mm rule beside the normalized ground-width board. The
+existing sibling `sym-lib-table` and `fp-lib-table` resolve to the checked-in
+local symbol and footprint libraries. Native KiCad 10.0.6 probes showed the
+rule removes all seven fine-escape width violations while retaining the
+ordinary 0.20 mm rule for a POWER_GND outside-normal probe; the board and
+schematic geometry were unchanged.
diff --git a/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_dru b/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_dru
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..7d41d7db
--- /dev/null
+++ b/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_dru
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+(version 1)
+(rule "jms583 local qfn escape"
+  (condition "A.NetName == 'XIN' || A.NetName == 'XOUT' || B.NetName == 'XIN' || B.NetName == 'XOUT'")
+  (constraint clearance (min 0.10mm))
+  (constraint track_width (min 0.10mm)))
diff --git a/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_pro b/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_pro
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..0967ef42
--- /dev/null
+++ b/pisxme/reva-clean/PHASE24_FCU_POWER_GND_WIDTH_NORMALIZED.kicad_pro
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+{}
